  "guide": "`TraceHilbertSpace`, `traceVector`, and `traceRepresentation` are $H_\\tau,\\xi_\\tau,\\pi_\\tau$. `TracialHilbertSpace family` is the different space $H_\\phi$. `traceGNSUnitary family` maps from $H_\\tau$ to $H_\\phi$; its `.symm.conjStarAlgEquiv` therefore sends an operator $R$ on $H_\\phi$ to $E^{-1}RE$ on $H_\\tau$. The complete RHS includes composition with `tracialRepresentation family`.",
  "website": {
